SUMMARY:Maddy Kelly Makes Her Bloomington Debut!
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington
DESCRIPTION:Maddy Kelly  is a Canadian born stand-up comedian\, writer\, a
 ctor\, and producer based in New York City. Raised by an Irish father and a
 n Indian mother\, her perspective is singular and off-beat but widely relat
 able. Currently headlining in clubs all over the U.S.\, Kelly’s stand-up 
 has been featured in The New Yorker\, The New York Times\, and Vulture\, an
 d has been recognized by The Webbys. She recently made her late-night debut
  on The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon. She also wrote for the political sa
 tire series This Hour Has 22 Minutes\, appeared in CBC’s The New Wave of 
 Standup\, and was a 2023  Just For Laughs  New Face. Check out her upcomi
 ng tour dates at  maddykelly.net .\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/com
 edy-atlas/event/maddy-kelly-makes-her-bloomington-debut-74996/
